Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.87,0:01:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第10集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.31,0:00:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如我一直说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's like I always say ...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:16.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就得是佼佼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you got to be the shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而大鱼吃小鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a shark's got to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:20.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要我自噬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bibbing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:23.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:26.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们让医生吃掉了他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's making the doctor eat himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:28.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们抓到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.53,0:00:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  那儿至少有四个利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, there are at least four Leviathans out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们连一个都弄不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know how to kill one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们就从正门进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it'll be quite a shock
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定吓掉他们大牙  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we walk in through the front door, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.81,0:00:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你们到底想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what you're up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:46.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  给你帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby, your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.69,0:00:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:00:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby? Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.10,0:01:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.41,0:01:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  他死了吗  -我还在确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, is he dead? - I'm checking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.41,0:01:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到底死了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he dead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开你的车吧  迪恩  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just drive, Dean! Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:17.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得把情况告诉我  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to talk to me, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  他还有呼吸和脉搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, he's breathing. There's a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扶他坐起来  帮他止血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him upright. Stop the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.36,0:01:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又不是白痴  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not an idiot, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.55,0:01:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道怎么给头部中弹的人做急救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know first aid for a friggin' bullet to the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-最近的急救中心在哪  -挺住  挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need the nearest trauma center. - Hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把地址告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the address?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.95,0:01:29.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你给我挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Bobby, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:45.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  坚持住啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby? Just hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.18,0:02:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们找到菲尔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we found Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.47,0:02:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里感觉不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.35,0:02:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是嘛  鲍比  树上吊着个死人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no kidding, Bobby. There's a corpse in a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感到了不祥之兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something bad's about to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:19.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  鲍比  危险无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, danger's kind of on the W2, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.55,0:02:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才要带枪过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we got the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能不详已经发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or something bad's happened already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.09,0:02:44.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们说说到底怎么回事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you want to tell us what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.63,0:02:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你的头怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What's going on with your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我头部中弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got shot in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  今天我们一直在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, we've been with you all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:54.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是中弹了  我们肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think we would have noticed if you took a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:55.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是在这儿中的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't take one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I took one out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:02:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在现实世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.30,0:03:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没听懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  鲍比  你要不要先坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bobby, you ... you want to sit down, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.19,0:03:04.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我有事要告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's something I got to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, I can't get at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  慢慢想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I-it's okay. Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ... we're right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是指眼前的"你们"\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, not you you ...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是真正的你们  现实中的你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real you, o-out there in ... in the waking world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,号码  号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numbers. Numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里有纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:26.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前没有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have time before...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你们他们的阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}...to tell you what they're cooking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.03,0:03:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们需要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:40.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么傻站着  不打算给我了吗  鲍比  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you just gonna stand there or hand it over, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.29,0:03:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你希望是法拉·弗西特吗(美国女演员)\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were expecting Farrah Fawcett?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  她不像你  来之前连电话都不打\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. She always calls first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.03,0:03:56.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时我就是怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said the first time this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:16.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里一点都没变样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just like it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别光说好听的了  快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit sweet-talking and come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.77,0:04:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉我们好久没聊天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like we haven't talked in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我也深有体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know just how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:32.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen ...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有事想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something I want to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:37.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次别找借口了  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No excuses this time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下吧  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sit, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这是哪天晚上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what night this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.87,0:04:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得这一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事我想了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've thought about this a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我真的想好了  -想好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I really sat with this. - Sat with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别逗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make fun of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:04:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:01.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now I got to ...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不记得那晚有暴风雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember a storm coming in the night this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:34.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣母玛丽啊  我脑子里还真是一锅粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother Mary, I've got a messed-up fruitcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了  对不起  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go. I'm sorry, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的诀窍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one trick
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:52.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是要装作轻车熟路  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to act like you know what you're doing, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.57,0:05:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:54.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  现在不需要我的建议了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, I can't give you advice now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你突然就变得无所不知了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of a sudden, you know everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全可以坐在车里  啥都不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can always go wait in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  等等  我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. I-I need your help ...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-非常需要  -不需要才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- bad. - Yeah, damn straight you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:04.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  鲁弗斯  我就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen to me, Rufus. I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整天出去捉鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now, that's a realistic view
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.21,0:06:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难免搭上老命\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the mortality rate on a ghost hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖  红色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, Nellie, red line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.79,0:06:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  小子  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, baby boy, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Rufus ...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底进不进来  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you coming, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没那么多时间让你耗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're not getting any younger here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.89,0:06:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝会惩罚你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's gonna punish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  辛格先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mr. Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.55,0:07:26.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的时辰到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:35.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你是来终结我的死神喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're my reaper, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说过你们会在光天化日之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've heard of you guys grabbing reapees
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.76,0:07:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是睡梦中取人性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}in broad daylight and in their sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.89,0:07:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我从没听说过死神还会出现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I never heard of a reaper showing up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人的脑浆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside a guy's custard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你昏迷了  是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a coma, genius. This is what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.93,0:07:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爬进你的脑浆  把你捞出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I climb in your...custard and fish you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.90,0:07:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为可以甩掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think you can lose me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:07:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还要四处赶场子  辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got places to be, Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别浪费我的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't waste my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不浪白不浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:03.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁我还有时间可浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:08.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该来的总要来  你不过是在拖延罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're prolonging the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逃不出我的掌心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can find you anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这酒气冲天的老鼠洞也藏不住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in this gin-soaked rat maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说  看  这都没啥可比性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying ... look, you can't really compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在都有点不认识你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:28.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他俩差得太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not even a contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这要看你的标准\N{\fnArial\fs30}It depends on the criteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,存活下来是唯一的标准  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival is the only criteria, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:33.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情势一触即发时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the crap hits the fan,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.81,0:08:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有格斗技巧没啥关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not about who has skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有关系的是谁最凶恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about who's the bigger badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你能告诉萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, will you please tell Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,李连杰不是查克·诺里斯(美国电影演员)的对手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Chuck Norris could kick Jet Li's ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便帮我拿瓶啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab me a beer while you're in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.63,0:08:52.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比·辛格  你下来时最好已经收拾干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Singer, you had better be washed up when you come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:01.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好脏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, what is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:04.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直像是故意惹他生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like you want him to get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  接住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew! Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.49,0:09:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结婚典礼上被甩  愤而自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets left at the altar, kills herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,葬在这地穴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then gets buried in the crypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在她追杀所有伤了女人心的负心汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she's going after men who break their girls' hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺凄美的吧  我没说错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poignant, am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么上气不接下气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you out of breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚去慢跑了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you go for a jog up there, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你的帮助  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.97,0:09:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  显然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  拿个喷火器过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to grab a torch, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一打开她的棺材\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I open up her coffin,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她肯定会立刻发起猛攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}showtime's coming pretty quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  你能不能听我说  你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Will you listen to me, you son of a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个死神要收走我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a damn reaper coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.31,0:09:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们每一个人都被死神追着索命呢  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a damn reaper coming for all of us, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  咱们赶紧收拾掉这鬼魂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's put this damn ghost to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.39,0:09:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还要好好过普珥节(犹太教假期)呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got plans for Purim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.39,0:09:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.39,0:09:49.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧呼叫待命的神经外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Page the neurosurgeon on call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通知手术室让不紧急的病人先等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell O.R. to put electives on hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.41,0:09:53.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七号台空下就将外伤二号病人转移过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move trauma 2 to bed 7 as soon as it's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,右额叶区有枪伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunshot wound to the right frontal area.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有发现其他外伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No exit wound found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:10:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能自主呼吸  呼吸频率18十分微弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathing spontaneously. Respiratory rate 18 and shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,RTS指数120  血压90  60\N{\fnArial\fs30}RST at 120. B.P. 90 over 60.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.05,0:10:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格拉斯昏迷评分为5\N{\fnArial\fs30}GCS 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:05.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,80克甘露醇30分钟静推\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push 80 grams of mannitol over 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-准备插管  -呼吸道通畅  \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Prep for intubation. - Air entry clear to bases.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上拿一个中央管来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get a central line in here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样了  能不能告诉我们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? Please just tell us ...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.59,0:10:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们赶紧出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你们不能影响医生的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. You need to stay out of their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.49,0:10:13.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那是我们的叔叔  -你们得出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's our uncle. - You got to stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们在干什么  -我们得先把他稳定下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are they doing? - We need to get him stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  你们会把子弹取出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, when are you gonna take the bullet out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能让脑部的肿胀消退\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can get the swelling down,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:19.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果子弹在我们能触及的地方  如果...\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it's in a place we can get to, if ...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他还能活到那时\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he even lives that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:31.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算我没说  我得继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. I got to keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:35.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,负心汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heartbreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再10分钟静推30克甘露醇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push 30 more of mannitol over 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做血细胞计数  挂上500毫升的生理盐水\N{\fnArial\fs30}CBC and 'lytes. Bolus him with 500 saline.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:48.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两分钟前生命指数还稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vitals were stable two minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可他现在不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's crashing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:55.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要伤碎你的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll break your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你没事吧  说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You okay? Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血压130  90\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood pressure 130 over 90.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  鲁弗斯  我要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Rufus, I need you ...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.52,0:11:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.31,0:11:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是那次你险些送命的活\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would be the one job you damn near got yourself killed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算要我背着你  你也得帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're gonna be useful, even if I have to carry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他暂时稳定下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh, stable for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能等待观察了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just have to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼你哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫你呢  小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you! You, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:32.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么像个小白兔似地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you making like a white rabbit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:34.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处出现呢  你这小鬼头\N{\fnArial\fs30}all over the place for, you grubby little ...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再突然蹦出来吓人了  小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough with the jump scares, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在追你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you running from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.85,0:12:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:48.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think I was dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:52.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回头给我打电话  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再为我哭哭啼啼了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't sit shiva for me yet, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被那疯新娘打昏后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, after bridezilla took you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得你告诉过我  你的濒死经历吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you remember what you told me about your near-death experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还什么都没告诉你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't told you nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你既然提到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很确定我差点就过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty sure I almost crossed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都看见什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见什么了  伙计你干嘛这么激动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I see? What are you so riled up about, paco?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见一个门厅  铺着格子地毯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a hallway, uh, plaid carpet,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:17.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还有我小时候住的楼  -然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- uh, the apartment building from when I was a kid. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我想跑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要死在那破格子地摊上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not dying on no damn plaid carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不必  多谢美意  -那么你是怎么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, thank you. - So, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:26.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很明显啊  鲍比  不能犯傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, obviously, Bobby, not being stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.09,0:13:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始找出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started looking for the damn exit door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.27,0:13:30.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓这就是他们说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you know, I swear that's what they mean
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.18,0:13:31.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的生活片段从你眼前闪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your life flashing before your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我每次打开一扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause every time I opened the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面都是我的一段记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was another chapter inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:36.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些好事  坏事  还有那些血腥的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}the good, the bad, the bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.45,0:13:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你是怎么跑出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how did you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.80,0:13:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然要找到正确的门啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found the right door, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很简答  我往深处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, simple ... I went deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.81,0:13:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深处  你是说很久远的记忆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep. Like old?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  深处是像\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, deep like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些你不想再回想起的破事\N{\fnArial\fs30}crap you do not want to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:51.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它埋在心底  用其他的破事掩埋它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you bury it, you shove other crap over it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后你再也不去想它  再也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't go there, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.74,0:13:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're telling me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去的路  是走过你最不堪回首的记忆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the way out was through your worst memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一扇很重要的门  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an important door, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  真很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这么追问不休是干嘛呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you going on about, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.49,0:14:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得找到正确的门把这东西送到萨姆和迪恩手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to find the right door to get this to Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在处于昏迷状态  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a coma, Rufus, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:18.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的大脑袋中弹了  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got shot in the dunce cap, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ... I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.45,0:14:22.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的是我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.57,0:14:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我他妈勒个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be a prima ballerina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  鲍比  你是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, Bobby are you trying to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是你一段比较美好的记忆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just one of your better memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我骗你做什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would I make this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好了  我得走了  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. I got to go. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.45,0:14:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你得跟我一起走  鲁弗斯  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're coming with me, Rufus. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:40.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一个搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need my partner on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想你最不堪的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aim for your worst memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集中注意力想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think. Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗  最差的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it? The worst, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:56.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那多了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a metric ton of worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:14:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挑一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:01.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  那个杀人新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, killer bride ...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么喊你负心汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come she call you a heartbreaker, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.33,0:15:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果说我还见过一个顾家的男人  就是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you a family man if I ever saw one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:09.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢帮我缩小范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for narrowing things down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.99,0:15:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:23.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.27,0:15:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都是谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们全部的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our whole life...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our vows...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.27,0:15:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我想要孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew I wanted kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你就不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下来然后告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}sit me down and say...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:56.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也会是个好爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be a good dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.70,0:16:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些话是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that even mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.51,0:16:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你碰什么毁什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You break everything you touch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.53,0:16:07.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那算什么借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of excuse is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你伤透了我的心  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke my heart, Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开心了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉你  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都很愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never stopped being sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我以为你想要一窝孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I thought you'd want a gang of rugrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:47.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事多久以后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how long after this ...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:49.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就被附身了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she get possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:56.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.43,0:17:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我最后悔的一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biggest regret of my life, this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会以为我刺死她是最后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think it was when I had to stab her to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}but...no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All through that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.07,0:17:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都想着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都没机会言归于好\N{\fnArial\fs30}we never got to get past this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若早知当初\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'd have known,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就会都说些她爱听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have said anything she wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:44.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试那个门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是那一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}What year is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.14,0:18:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,89年吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'89-ish?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还不是困在这该死的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still stuck in eternal friggin' sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我只是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was just thinking, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来挺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}you look pretty good there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定没喝高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have drank less.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我们这是去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.25,0:18:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这看起来像哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dean, where's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.21,0:18:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸说我应该练双筒枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad says I'm supposed to practice with the double-barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:50.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们不练枪  过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're gonna skip the guns today. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就好好扔这个球\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna throw a ball around,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.64,0:18:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像个普通的鼻涕虫那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like a regular snot-nosed little jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.49,0:19:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个宁可伤老婆心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for a guy who'd rather break his wife's heart
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:05.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不跟她生娃娃的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}than give her a baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当起保姆来还真不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}you make a hell of a nanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.47,0:19:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该去找下一扇门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need another door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  鲍比  你是怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, though, Bobby, how come ...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别问了  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dog with a bone, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我真的想知道  \N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I really want to know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不要孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why no kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:27.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没那么复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.26,0:19:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老爸是个恶棍酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad was a mean drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怕我跟他一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured I'd be just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.53,0:19:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解我的  我说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, hey, look ... I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要把这传下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sense passing on the legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.85,0:19:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对你自己太严苛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you're too hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你至多就是脾气差的酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're more of a cranky drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你又翻白眼  又冲我发火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know that whatever you're trying to avoid
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是想回避那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the eye rolls and the grump-a-lumping ...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最该去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's exactly where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.85,0:19:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我没回避什么  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I ain't avoiding nothing. - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚你的  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off my ass, rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我这不是在帮你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby, I'm trying to help you here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.84,0:19:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要从这儿出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.84,0:19:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.87,0:19:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么知道我不想让我知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to know what I don't want me to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.11,0:20:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,王子殿下决定大驾光临来吃宵夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crown prince decided to drop by for a late bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他刚刚在洗手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he ... he was just washing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那  谁来念祷文呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, w-who would like to say grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去他妈的祷文  把饼干递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell with grace. Pass me the biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.56,0:20:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是故意的  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你碰什么毁什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You break everything you touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我们好好吃晚饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just have a nice supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.23,0:20:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nice supper?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.17,0:20:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your nice supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.05,0:21:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这家里得不到尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get no respect in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.99,0:21:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.93,0:21:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在可别跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you can't tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这记忆差得不够进去一探究竟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wasn't gnarly enough to go spelunking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.81,0:21:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个周二都是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was any given Tuesday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:27.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  没什么特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me ... it was nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.63,0:21:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不  你怕了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.94,0:21:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.52,0:21:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道我们进错地方了  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know we're in the wrong place, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  鲍比  你没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Bobby, you don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.59,0:21:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是变天了  你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sound was not the weather, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.70,0:21:40.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能再这么一扇一扇门的找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't keep bopping through your greatest hits forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.05,0:21:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死神马上就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That reaper's gonna catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.35,0:21:45.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有办法阻止他还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if there was some way to stop the damn thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:49.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那可是死神  鲍比  你完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's a reaper, Bobby. You're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:52.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们该干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.11,0:21:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要阻止那该死的死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna stop the damn reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:21:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就什么也干不了了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, there's nothing else we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.64,0:22:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我们只能等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. We just have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.45,0:22:02.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还得看肿胀能不能消  -等多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll see if the swelling goes down. - How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的情况  很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to say in cases like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.55,0:22:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能坚持到现在  总是好事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's lasted this long. That's something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.93,0:22:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  子弹没有碎掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen ... the bullet didn't shatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.15,0:22:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大脑只有一个半球受损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one hemisphere of his brain was injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.93,0:22:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are all positive things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.84,0:22:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  我不想给你们虚幻的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...I don't want to give you false hope here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.79,0:22:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他陷入深度昏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's far from out of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.55,0:22:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多数情况下  这样的病例\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the time, cases like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都救不活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.81,0:22:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就看他自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now it comes down to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.62,0:22:32.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有进一步消息我会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep you updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.27,0:22:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.06,0:22:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打扰你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们谁是罗伯特·辛格的近亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is one of you Robert Singer's next of kin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.32,0:22:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你们现在很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know this is a stressful time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.55,0:22:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  无意冒犯  但废话就省了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay. No offense ... you can skip the garnish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:53.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他的保险失效了  还是咋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did his insurance lapse, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.75,0:22:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sorry to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.89,0:22:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  你叔叔有没有表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, um, did your uncle ever make his wishes known
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.89,0:23:01.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于器官捐献的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}i-in regards to organ donation?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,器官只在很短的时间段内可用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Organs are only viable for a very limited window ...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.09,0:23:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"可用"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Viable"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.19,0:23:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是希望能从不幸中孕育福音\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just hoping some good can come of this tragic ...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.25,0:23:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  我只说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. I'm gonna say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会死  只是一枚子弹而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna die. It's one bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.17,0:23:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会有事  因为他向来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be fine because he's always fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.70,0:23:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.84,0:23:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛一副他已经死了的腔调跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you talking to me like he's gonna die, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我干我该干的  你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do my job! Do your jobs!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.96,0:23:28.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-救活他  -当然  他们在尽全力抢救\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Save him! - Of course they're doing everything they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.03,0:23:34.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给哥滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.13,0:23:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.89,0:23:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(汉默顿地区医院)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.49,0:24:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克  我知道你在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick! I know you're in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.42,0:24:11.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out, you dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.78,0:24:16.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你来了结未完成的工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did you come here to finish the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.96,0:24:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗  来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.11,0:24:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这儿  就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.25,0:24:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光天化日  你我对决  来吧迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}out in the open, you and me, Dick Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.02,0:24:24.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.96,0:24:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扮成知名人士也不都是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deciding to jump a famous guy ain't all upside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.81,0:24:31.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在就可以杀了我  不过会被传到网上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kill me right now ... you want to see it online.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.99,0:24:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是去看看你的朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should go check on that friend of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.98,0:24:36.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他现在肯定不那么闹腾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't be feeling too frisky right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.21,0:24:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是神枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a very good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.56,0:24:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.57,0:24:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是要伤到你  而是要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not just to hurt you ... to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.14,0:24:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.16,0:24:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了  迪恩  我死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean. I can't be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.45,0:24:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就让你求死不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wish you could, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.33,0:24:53.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大言不惭\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some conviction.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.91,0:24:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真是揣着一肚子劲儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd really crush it on the motivational circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.24,0:24:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑成这样  不是为了掩饰你害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're either laughing because you're scared
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.54,0:24:59.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是脑子缺弦\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're laughing because you're stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.57,0:25:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回见  迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you soon, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.45,0:25:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一本钦定本圣经里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in an old King James Bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.57,0:25:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底要做什么  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what exactly are we doing now, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.93,0:25:32.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准确地说  你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, technically, you're correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.00,0:25:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能阻止一个死神  至少不能永远阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop a reaper, not permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.93,0:25:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只有他们老大才办得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only their boss can do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.24,0:25:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不想把他扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we don't want him involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.99,0:25:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算不是无米之炊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're cooking with gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.57,0:25:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.32,0:25:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Sam and Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.78,0:25:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟这帮怂货打过两三次照面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}have run up against these suckers a couple, three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.78,0:25:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我学了几招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picked up a few tricks ...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:26:01.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少能拖住他们一会儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough to slow them down a hair, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.09,0:26:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们施咒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's work some mojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.69,0:26:30.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那家伙想干嘛  -没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did that guy want? - Uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.49,0:26:31.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是保险的破事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some insurance mook.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.21,0:26:34.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克·罗曼刚刚在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Roman was out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.76,0:26:36.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.83,0:26:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事...暂时没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing...For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.36,0:26:41.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是场瞪眼比赛罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a friggin' staring contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.96,0:26:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.80,0:26:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the update?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.02,0:26:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肿胀消退了一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The swelling's down a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.26,0:26:50.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不再给他打镇静剂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took him off sedation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.05,0:26:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他开始抵抗给他插的管子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he ... he started fighting his tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.00,0:26:54.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们就把管子拔出来了  他现在时自主呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they pulled them out, and he's breathing on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.57,0:26:56.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是好事吧  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good, right? Is that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.46,0:27:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  医生说是最佳情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, doctor said best-case scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.15,0:27:02.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  那他们什么时候取出子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so when they gonna take the bullet out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.78,0:27:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  他们根本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, t-they're not even ...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.93,0:27:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们根本没那个打算  暂时没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're not even gonna try that, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.07,0:27:11.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说是"磨损"\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word's "abrading," I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.58,0:27:14.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说人话\N{\fnArial\fs30}English.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.53,0:27:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要切除死去的脑组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cutting out the dead brain tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.55,0:27:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还得医生认为值得冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's if the doctor even thinks it's worth the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.93,0:27:23.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能跟你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.26,0:27:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  谈什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Talk about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.59,0:27:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.29,0:27:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  我们不谈这个  -我们必须谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, we're not gonna have that conversation. - Oh, we need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.34,0:27:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他不会死的  -这难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not gonna die. - He might.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.86,0:27:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -迪恩  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - Dean, listen ...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.07,0:27:45.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to brace ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.15,0:27:47.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -因为这是来真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Because it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.22,0:27:51.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.10,0:27:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想我们抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to hug and ...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.26,0:27:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么爸爸死的时候我们也撑过去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and say we made it through it when dad died?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.21,0:27:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们经历了太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.38,0:28:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还需要金矿石  铁杉和权杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still need gold ore, hemlock, and mace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.54,0:28:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是些普通的东西喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. So, pretty basic, then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.34,0:29:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  事实上  我们没练习开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we didn't shoot rifles, as a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.62,0:29:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们扔球玩来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We threw a ball around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.64,0:29:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个孩子  约翰  他们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a kid, John. They both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.53,0:29:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有权这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're entitled.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.07,0:29:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我知道我不是他们的爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know I ain't their dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.35,0:29:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.56,0:29:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.81,0:30:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妙招啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.36,0:30:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to admit ...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.50,0:30:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还是第一次有人在昏迷中对我使这招呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}first time anyone's pulled one on me while actually unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.06,0:30:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.85,0:30:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别急着溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.78,0:30:16.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.91,0:30:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  还有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Other business.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.92,0:30:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是想帮你  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to help you, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.94,0:30:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.40,0:30:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你把我定在这儿就能阻止得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you can stop it by pinning me like a bug?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.88,0:30:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well ...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.76,0:30:30.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都看见了  黑暗降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen the dark coming ...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.69,0:30:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们消失  一片空白\N{\fnArial\fs30}people disappearing, things going blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.35,0:30:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四下看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.76,0:30:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个细胞接着一个细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell by cell...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.28,0:30:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,子弹在蚕食你的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}that bullet's killing your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.96,0:30:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就要无处可逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're running out of places to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.40,0:30:52.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要知道  这个陷阱撑不了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, understand ... this trap won't hold forever
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.11,0:30:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这间屋子撑不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}because this room won't hold
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.69,0:30:59.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.60,0:31:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.56,0:31:05.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.86,0:31:07.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就此了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.22,0:31:10.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.29,0:31:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然就抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.98,0:31:16.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.30,0:31:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.89,0:31:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好说啊  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.26,0:31:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想困在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you really want to get stuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.35,0:31:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成鬼魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn into some ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.78,0:31:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我在做什么  鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'm doing, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.26,0:31:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  是啊  你在想你能帮助那俩小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, you're thinking you can help those boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.33,0:31:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你遇见几个头脑正常的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how many sprits you meet in their right mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.69,0:31:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会有个猎人灭了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some hunter's gonna cut you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.54,0:31:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底哪边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose side are you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.85,0:31:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.77,0:31:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出过力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.66,0:31:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的生命渺小而平凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got handed a small, unremarkable life,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.99,0:31:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却有所作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you did something with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.31,0:31:54.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分你这样的男人都一边看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most men like you die of liver disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.77,0:31:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《巴尼·米勒》的重播  死于肝病\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching "Barney Miller" reruns.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.77,0:31:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.90,0:32:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.86,0:32:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.81,0:32:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不在乎  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't care. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.15,0:32:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they're my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.15,0:32:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.01,0:32:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要想出去  只能走到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way out is through.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.43,0:32:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.62,0:32:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能再见到你真好  老伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice seeing you again, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.63,0:32:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你陪我聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.51,0:32:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.58,0:32:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一会儿就收拾好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll just take a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.99,0:32:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就那么坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gonna sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.08,0:32:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找把扫帚什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a broom or somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.19,0:32:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他为什么这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why he's like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.67,0:33:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为你总是顺着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you let him do whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.77,0:33:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  你瞧  我就收拾好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. See? I'm almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.98,0:33:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就放松一下  再喝一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just relax a-and have another drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.80,0:33:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别对我指手画脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.30,0:33:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.63,0:33:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.92,0:33:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... no!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.28,0:33:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么总挑他的刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you always provoke him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.81,0:33:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他是个坏孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's a bad kid ...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.76,0:33:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.71,0:33:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈的放屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a load of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.65,0:33:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么资格说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell were you to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.30,0:33:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你老子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.22,0:33:35.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要对我尊敬点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you show your father respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.15,0:33:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你值得我尊敬再说  你个醉鬼恶霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day he deserves it, you drunken bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打女人  打孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punching women and kids ...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.29,0:33:43.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们那个年代这样就叫为人父吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what they call fatherhood in your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.33,0:33:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是欠打  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you deserved it. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.02,0:33:47.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是不知好歹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were nothing but ungrateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.47,0:33:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.44,0:33:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子哪知道好歹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids ain't supposed to be grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.53,0:33:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是吃你的还伤你心\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're supposed to eat your food and break your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.28,0:33:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这自私的混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}you selfish dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.77,0:33:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死了我还那么害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You died, and I was still so afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.84,0:34:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怕我会变成你  结果我自己都没有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd turn into you I never even had kids of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.21,0:34:02.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.21,0:34:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正你碰什么毁什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You break everything you touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.57,0:34:10.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运弄人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as fate would have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.83,0:34:15.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我收养了两个男孩  他们都长大成材\N{\fnArial\fs30}I adopted two boys, and they grew up great.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.55,0:34:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成了英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}They grew up heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.25,0:34:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你他妈去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.20,0:34:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,病床摇起准备转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the head of the bed up for transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.88,0:34:25.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,静脉注射可以暂停  保持静脉通畅即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.V. can run off the pump. Just run a TKVO.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.46,0:34:27.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们得等呼吸机  -等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll have to wait for respiratory. - Wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.77,0:34:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么回事  -他出现有反应的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening? - He's showing signs of responsiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.26,0:34:31.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要送他去手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking him up for surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.55,0:34:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们想见他  就赶快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to see him, I'd squeeze in there quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.39,0:34:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我说  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I said that I'm ... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.35,0:34:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  是啊  你总是那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, you say that every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.88,0:34:43.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你停手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.35,0:34:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  这次  你给我听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! This time, you listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.36,0:34:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.24,0:34:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你闹什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.32,0:35:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要用这东西你还不够爷们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not half enough man to use that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.55,0:35:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让大人先把事说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave the adults to sort this out...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.31,0:35:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我待会儿再来收拾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will deal with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.65,0:35:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh! Aah! Bobby, just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.76,0:35:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按他说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.32,0:35:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快走  -不  别碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just go. No. - Leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.68,0:35:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你做了什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.85,0:35:34.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝会惩罚你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God is gonna punish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.98,0:35:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做了你必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did what you had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.95,0:35:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是这时明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you learn that...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.12,0:35:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被救的人几乎从不说谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}they pretty much never say thanks when you save 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.59,0:35:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去找把铲子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go get a shovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.17,0:35:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他埋在木棚后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bury the old man out behind the woodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.01,0:36:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没见过连脑子中弹都遗传的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the only genetic case of bullet in the brain I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.18,0:36:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么急  辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so fast, Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.30,0:36:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. We need to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.41,0:36:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.63,0:36:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.30,0:36:36.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只想说  谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}...just...thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.24,0:36:41.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为我们做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}...for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.20,0:36:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好了  请后退  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Please step back. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.91,0:36:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等  停下  他睁眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait. Stop. His eyes are open.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.18,0:36:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.93,0:37:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What ...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.77,0:37:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说话  别说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk. Don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.98,0:37:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笔  给  给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pen ... I ... here. Here, here, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.07,0:37:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.36,0:37:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.53,0:37:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.30,0:38:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼叫  来外伤室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call a code ... trauma room.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.23,0:38:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在酿酒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You microbrewing in there, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.19,0:38:48.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  我们还有很多查克·诺里斯电影要看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on ... we got a lot of Chuck Norris to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.13,0:38:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动作麻利点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.53,0:39:00.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮啊  居然醒过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice move, waking up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.47,0:39:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有动力才有一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motivation's a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.74,0:39:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白外面为什么一片漆黑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why it's dark out there, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.60,0:39:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这栋房子  是你最后的孤岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This house ... it's your last island,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.86,0:39:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他的一切都被子弹抹去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything else melted by that bullet ...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.52,0:39:17.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.10,0:39:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你最后的机会  跟我走  往前看\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your last chance to come with me and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.57,0:39:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为你自己好  鲍比  放手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your own good, Bobby, let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.27,0:39:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有你他们也能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be okay without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.85,0:39:43.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后的记忆了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last memory, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.34,0:39:50.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我把最好的留到最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad I saved the best for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.85,0:39:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠边闪  二逼青年  对你老哥尊敬点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, scoot, jerkface. Show your elders some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.37,0:39:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你闪吧  讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scoot, ass-hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.06,0:40:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你加甘草汁了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get licorice?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.10,0:40:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没  没加甘草汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we did not get licorice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.85,0:40:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是好零食  甘草汁多恶心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got good snacks. Licorice is disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.96,0:40:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我不太理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't quite understand that,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.67,0:40:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花生酱加香蕉三文治你倒觉得美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, Mr. Peanut-butter-and-banana sandwiches?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.27,0:40:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我就是挺我的三文治\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I stand by that sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.87,0:40:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人喜欢甘草汁  味同泥土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody likes licorice. I-it's ... it's made of dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.20,0:40:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是经典的电影零食\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a classic movie food.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.72,0:40:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与爆米花并列\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right up there with popcorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.13,0:40:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-爆米花  不是吧  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Popcorn? Really? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.35,0:40:26.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.44,0:40:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  简直是口嚼天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What ... it's like little chewy pieces of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.03,0:40:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话娘们说还差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, chewy pieces of heaven if you're a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.82,0:40:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.15,0:40:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是走是留  你怎么打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay or go ... what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
